Part B — Implementation Plan
Scene Architecture
Scene	Root Node	Key Children	Purpose
Main.tscn	Node3D	GameManager, DayNightCycle, WeatherSystem	Master scene, owns all global state
Diner.tscn	Node3D	CounterSurface, Corkboard, SpawnPoints, WorldEnvironment	The only playable 3D space
Player.tscn	CharacterBody3D	Camera3D, RayCast3D	First-person controller; raycast picks up NPC-left items only
NPC.tscn	CharacterBody3D	AnimationPlayer, NavigationAgent3D, DialogueTrigger	Shared base scene for all NPCs
CounterSurface.tscn	Node3D	StaticBody3D, ItemSpawnPoints	Physical surface where NPCs leave 3D items for pickup
CookingUI.tscn	CanvasLayer	PantryPanel, VirtualCounter (2D), CombineButton, ResultSlot	2D overlay; all cooking happens here, no 3D interaction
Corkboard.tscn	Node3D	ItemSlots (Node3D array), CloseUpCamera	Physical board; 2D items rendered as plane meshes
UI.tscn	CanvasLayer	RecipeLog, DialogueBox, RelationshipMeter, SavingsDisplay, DayTransition	All HUD and UI panels including passage cost tracker

